    "body": "Explore the lesson here. Canvas holds your check-ins, submissions, feedback, and progress.\nReturn to this lesson\nA complete classroom starting point\nCedar Desk\nA fictional workshop-support case. Supplied evidence supports practice; it does not prove real-world need or adoption."
