    "body": "Explore the lesson here. Canvas holds your check-ins, submissions, feedback, and progress.\nReturn to this lesson\nBring the evidence together\nWhat will happen next?\nFinish with a usable solution, an honest recommendation, and a clear handoff.\n0 of 12 units marked complete\nStudy markers help you navigate. Review your actual evidence against the five milestones before calling the project complete.\nLet someone use the artifact and locate its instructions.\nShow the baseline, observed task, revision, retest, and limits.\nExplain intended impact, resource needs, release readiness, supported adoption, and the next decision.\nName the operating owner, human review, exceptions, and stopping conditions.\nAdd your project evidence and reflection to the check-in in Canvas.\nReview the learning path\nSelf-study completion is not a credential. In a taught offering, follow the published submission and feedback process."
