    "body": "Explore the lesson here. Canvas holds your check-ins, submissions, feedback, and progress.\nReturn to this lesson\nFacilitation guide\nKeep the path. Adapt the problem.\nThe instructional core stays stable while the partner, context, tools, and calendar change."
