    "section": "Workload and individual evidence",
    "url": "/teaching/ai-solutions/instructor.html#section-4",
    "body": "Plan two short individual checks near Milestones 3 and 5. Ask each learner to interpret a number, defend a choice, and name a limitation. Reuse project evidence rather than adding another paper.\nThe initial design estimate is 37–63 learner hours including guided work and additional project work, not a credit-hour claim. For 30 learners in ten teams, five 15-minute milestone reviews require about 12.5 hours; two five-minute individual checks require five hours, excluding preparation, teaching, and resubmissions. Pilot and revise these estimates."
