    "body": "Missing evidence is not yet demonstrated. Partial or unreliable evidence is developing. Strong work explains a new case or alternative interpretation. A favorable project result is not required; the quality of evidence and judgment matters.\nBefore saving this snapshot\nImpact and quality measures fit the need; the resource/capacity table separates observations and assumptions.\nBase, unfavorable scenario, and named decision threshold agree.\nActual version/access status, scope, instructions, acceptance task, and support limit are concrete.\nBounded rollout and adoption measures identify owner, stage, denominator, period, and resource effort.\nOnboarding feedback, revision, next step, and observed or pending use are documented honestly.\nReturn to the Finish step →"
